    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on our company's company context as of 2025, our company's are confident in our company's ability to coordinate the consortium and deliver The solution while ensuring decision traceability and meeting the client's requirements." ;
