    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that integrates with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), supports health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and is hosted on infrastructure certified by French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The system must achieve a response time below 2 seconds and guarantee high availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack and performance benchmarks as of 2024, can our design an architecture that meets these technical requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company Faber IA has a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has components such as document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer. a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform is model-agnostic and can be containerized using Kubernetes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's requirements include integration with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), hosting on HDS-certified infrastructure, response time below 2 seconds, and high availability. our architecture and integration capabilities include API-first design with REST and webhook, support for HL7 and FHIR through our health interoperability capabilities, and standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration. our also have a partnership with Ligeo Santé for delivery." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds, common queries p95 latency below 2 seconds, and complex multi-source synthesis queries p95 latency below 2.5 seconds. our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and hosted on EU-only, renewable-powered infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering Our hosting options, our can design an architecture that meets the client's technical requirements by leveraging a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, integrating a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform with the required systems using our API-first approach and standard connectors, hosting a platform called Atelier which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform on our Sovereign HDS tier infrastructure which meets the HDS certification requirement, and utilizing our performance optimization capabilities to achieve the required response time and availability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance, including encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where relevant." ;
