    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's have ISO 27701 certification, which is an extension for privacy information management. our company's also comply with the Health Data Hosting (HDS) certification through our company's hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud. comply ensures that our company's processing on our hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud is covered and aligned with health data protection requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding data protection measures, our company's employ encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. our company's also utilize pseudonymisation, data minimization, and configurable retention. our company's system ensures strict isolation between client corpora, with per-engagement logical separation, role-based access control (RBAC), and audit logging of access and system outputs. our company's secure software development life cycle (SDLC) includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing performed by an external CREST-equivalent provider. our company's have defined remediation SLAs by severity for vulnerability management and a clear incident response plan with defined detection, notification, and remediation steps, including a breach notification delay of 72 hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's experience in delivering GDPR-compliant solutions to public-sector and health clients, including special-category (Art. 9) health data, I believe our company's can ensure the security and compliance posture for this project. our company's control mapping links platform features to applicable obligations, and audit evidence is available. our company's also support explainability and traceability, essential for AI systems, particularly in healthcare." ;
