        ex:hasText "However, it's crucial to note that while our company's has a strong foundation in security and compliance, the specifics of this project may require additional assessments or adaptations to ensure seamless integration without disrupting clinical or administrative workflows. our company's experience with EU regulatory frameworks, including GDPR and familiarity with the upcoming EU AI Act as of 2024, positions our company's well to navigate these requirements." ;
