    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance, our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds, common queries p95 latency below 2 seconds, and complex multi-source synthesis queries p95 latency below 2.5 seconds. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform expect to achieve high availability, targeting 99.9%, to support continuity of care. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier, which meets the HDS certification requirement and utilizes renewable energy. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, covering development, delivery, and operations, demonstrating our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform commitment to information security management. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform also comply with the Health Data Hosting (HDS) certification through our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

