        ex:hasText "As a Société par actions simplifiée registered in France, our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform have up-to-date social and fiscal obligations and administrative attestations available, including those required for French public procurement. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform intellectual property model is based on proprietary software licensed to clients under a subscription or usage model, and our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform use permissive open-source licenses for open-source components." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

