    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform Series A funding of €12,000,000 raised in 2024, our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform have a comfortable cash runway and a solid financial foundation. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform RAG approach grounds answers in the client's controlled corpus, ensuring explainability and traceability. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can leverage grounds to provide contextualization, drafting assistance, and support for medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) while demonstrating explainability and transparency. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform system provides source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval traces, and logs every interaction for posterior audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a responsible business, our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform prioritize sustainability and have an EcoVadis rating of Silver. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform partner with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud in the EU, which uses renewable energy and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, and our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform are committed to reducing our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform ethics charter includes principles such as human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and a documented data-use policy, aligning with regulatory requirements like the EU AI Act. our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform believe that our flagship product Atelier, a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform strong CSR and sustainability posture will contribute to sustainable development, while carefully managing trade-offs between high availability and energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

