    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, can our company's coordinate the consortium to deliver The solution while ensuring decision traceability? our company's can coordinate the consortium to deliver The solution. our company's has experience in delivering similar projects, particularly with our company's flagship product Atelier, which forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents.  our company's past references include working with a regional hospital group on a pilot assistant for medical documentation integrated with a regional hospital group electronic patient record, which is directly relevant to The solution. our company's also have partnerships with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, and Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, which will be beneficial in ensuring data sovereignty and integration with existing hospital systems. our company's project management methodology follows a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement includes two-week sprints with demonstrable increments and phases ending with formal reviews and go/no-go decisions, ensuring that The solution is delivered on time and meets the client's requirements. our company's have available capacity to dedicate a team to The solution, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead. our company's governance practices include a joint steering committee and operational committee with the client, ensuring regular communication and decision traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding decision traceability, our company's adapted version of standard public-sector project frameworks includes documented deliverables at each gate, and our company's can provide an audit trail of decisions made during The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
